  prevArrow: {fileID: 1673487023}
  nextArrow: {fileID: 417274466}
  diaryContent:
  - "15th Nov, 2016 \nWhy they keep arguing. Can they just listen to the other once? 
    \n\n16th Nov, 2016 \nThey have me to choose which one will ride me to extra class.
    I choose dad so not to bother mom, though i wish i could go with her  \n\n17th
    Nov, 2016 \nToday quite peaceful, at least they don't yell at each other \n\n30th
    Nov, 2016\nDAD K-I-L-L-E-D MOM. It's over. What will happen to me? I should have
    prevent it. But how? Dad's frightening. But if I had done something, things wouldn't
    have came this way. But dad is scary. I WANT TO DIE x100"
